stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Minted: Host mint
  Minted --> Active: issued under policy
  Active --> Consumed: once consume before effects
  Active --> Expired: outside validity (Host clock)
  Active --> Revoked: Host revoke
  Consumed --> [*]: replay refuses
  Expired --> [*]: verify refuses
  Revoked --> Reverse: reverse lineage under policy
  Reverse --> [*]
